#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0367 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "MECHANISM PIN - the JOINED column is absent (distinct from AD0210's absent-DATASET case, and from this rule's skipped_no_actarm_column, where the PRIMARY lacks the column). ⭐ Rewritten 2026-09-10 (R-4.12 hoist): join 1:1 matched, DM carries no ACTARM column, so Requirements.Variables.All [DM.ACTARM] reports an auditable skip naming DM instead of the Check executing to 0 violations."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ACTARM  type=Char
---
S1 | 01-701-1015 | DRUGA
---

dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
---
S1 | DM | 01-701-1015
